# The app first went live under /deploy/ (the whole project folder was dropped by mistake).
# Phones that installed it from there keep working and keep updating: anything under
# /deploy/ is answered with the same file from the root. A 200 rewrite keeps the address,
# so the service worker scope and the home screen icon stay where they were installed.
/deploy/*  /:splat  200
/deploy    /        200
